5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to see where the money actually goes before we promise anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We must verify who is actually available to staff the room next season.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The data on past visitor engagement is more important than the proposals.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The structural limits of the gallery are a non-negotiable constraint for us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to know where our previous deliveries failed so we can avoid it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, is the volunteer roster reliable enough to cover the gaps?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I am checking the staffing levels, not just the volunteers.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, if the floor can't hold it, the show is dead on arrival.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, exactly. I am looking into the structural survey and maintenance logs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I will check the lender paperwork to see where we slipped.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will review the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster composition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will examine the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the lender paperwork and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
