35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are eating a third of our installation budget. That is huge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person. We cannot process new loans at this rate.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"People come back for the live elements, not the static cases. The data is clear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The bay can only take four hundred kilos. Heavy stonework is out of the question.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two recent openings slipped because the paperwork arrived late. We need buffer time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the lab is that backlogged, how do we handle incoming items?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, we don't. We have to choose a show that requires minimal conservation work.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, does that rule out the maritime models? They seem heavy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, I need to check the specific weights, but the bay is the bottleneck.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the joiner's rate has also risen. Bespoke mounts are expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So we need something that arrives ready to go, without heavy custom mounts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,And it must not require the lab to clean or stabilize anything new.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,The comment slips say people want to see someone working. That fits a live demo.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A working conservation bench might be too risky for the floor load.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The evening hires mean we can't leave things open and unsecured.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
