60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Candidate A, Textiles, seems light and uses local craftspeople. No heavy loans.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Candidate A requires no conservation work on new items, just display.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,The live demonstrations in A match the visitor desire for presence.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Textiles are light. They fit the structural limits of the suspended bay easily.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Local sourcing means no distant lender paperwork delays. It is safe.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Candidate B, Light and Motion, needs powered displays. The maintenance log is scary.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,Candidate B requires rigging. The structural survey caps the bay weight strictly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"Candidate B is static in terms of human presence. It lacks the ""working"" element.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Candidate B's overhead rigging might exceed the four hundred kilo limit.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Candidate B's darkened zones are hard to secure for evening hires.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"Candidate C, Maritime, involves heavy models and distant loans. Too risky.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Candidate C requires conservation for the cargo objects. The lab is full.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
