73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Candidate C's stonework and models are too heavy for the bay.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,Candidate C relies on partner loans. The paperwork cut-offs are a nightmare.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"Candidate D, City Under Excavation, has a working bench. But is it safe?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Candidate D requires active conservation. We have no staff for that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,"Candidate D has the working element, but the finds need cleaning.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Candidate D's reconstructions might be too heavy. The bench is a liability.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Candidate D's finds are new. They need the lab. We are backlogged.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
